## Description

This detection identifies **Microsoft Sysmon Event ID 11 (File Create)**, which records when a new file is created on the monitored endpoint.

Monitoring file creation events provides defenders with visibility into malware payload drops, script creation, persistence mechanisms, and suspicious file activity. Threat actors frequently create files during execution, privilege escalation, persistence, and data staging.

This detection enables analysts to identify unexpected file creation events and investigate potential malicious activity.

